  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation ACT-60888 - EU Support Measures Facility BW = BW CSO allocation 2025 - Support to CSOs - Grants</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The overall objective of the support measures is to contribute to the implementation of Botswana&#xbf;s development agenda and support EU &#xbf; Botswana partnership, by promoting dialogue, expertise exchange, communication activities and engagement with civil society,&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The Support to CSOs aims at strengthening CSOs role as actors of governance in the area of public advocacy, transparency and democratic governance. It will also strengthen platforms for dialogue and exchanges in priority areas for the EU, including gender, human rights and youth engagement&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
